rage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 89.1%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.03"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":-125.16,"default_fair_val":-125.16,"premium_pct":-114.6,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":12.2,"pe_forward":10.7,"pb_trailing":0.9,"pb_forward":0.8,"div_yield":15.22,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":0.38,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":89.1,"cash_to_assets":1.5,"current_ratio":0.03,"roe":7.2,"roa":0.8,"moat":{"ticker":"NLY","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"NLY 作為抵押貸款 REIT，其品牌價值與定價權極為有限。公司主要依賴於市場利率和信貸環境，而非獨特的品牌吸引力或定價能力。其產品本質上是金融商品，客戶選擇的關鍵在於利率和條款，而非品牌忠誠度。與消費品或科技公司不同，NLY 的品牌在客戶決策中幾乎不扮演角色，這使其在定價方面缺乏實質性壁壘，容易受到市場波動和競爭對手的影響。其品牌知名度僅限於金融市場參與者，對終端客戶的影響力微乎其微。","comment_en":"As a mortgage REIT, NLY's brand value and pricing power are extremely limited. The company primarily relies on market interest rates and credit conditions, rather than unique brand appeal or pricing ability. Its products are essentially financial commodities, where customer choice hinges on rates and terms, not brand loyalty. Unlike consumer goods or tech companies, NLY's brand plays a negligible role in customer decisions, leaving it with no substantial pricing power barrier and susceptible to market volatility and competitors. Its brand recognition is confined to financial market participants, with minimal influence on end customers."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"抵押貸款 REIT 業務模式高度依賴於金融監管框架，而非專利或獨特的技術創新。NLY 的運營受到嚴格的金融法規約束，但這些法規並未構成其獨特的競爭壁壘，反而可能限制其業務發展。公司無法透過專利來保護其核心業務，任何金融產品或服務的創新都容易被模仿。監管環境的變化可能對 NLY 產生重大影響，但這並非由公司自身創造的、可持續的護城河，而是外部環境的挑戰。","comment_en":"The mortgage REIT business model relies heavily on the financial regulatory framework, not patents or unique technological innovations. NLY's operations are strictly governed by financial regulations, but these regulations do not constitute a unique competitive barrier; rather, they may limit its business development. The company cannot protect its core business through patents, and any innovation in financial products or services is easily replicated. Changes in the regulatory environment can significantly impact NLY, but this is not a sustainable moat created by the company itself, but rather an external environmental challenge."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"NLY 的客戶轉換成本相對較低。對於機構投資者而言，更換抵押貸款 REIT 供應商通常涉及重新評估利率、風險和服務條款，但這並非一個極其複雜或耗時的過程。雖然存在一定的交易成本和盡職調查時間，但與需要深度整合或改變工作流程的企業服務相比，其轉換門檻不高。客戶可以相對容易地比較不同 REIT 的產品，並在認為條件更有利時進行轉換，這削弱了 NLY 的客戶黏性。","comment_en":"NLY's customer switching costs are relatively low. For institutional investors, changing mortgage REIT providers typically involves re-evaluating interest rates, risks, and service terms, but it is not an extremely complex or time-consuming process. While there are some transaction costs and due diligence time, the switching barrier is not high compared to enterprise services requiring deep integration or workflow changes. Customers can relatively easily compare products from different REITs and switch when conditions are perceived as more favorable, which weakens NLY's customer stickiness."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NLY 的業務模式不具備顯著的網絡效應。作為一家抵押貸款 REIT，其價值和收入主要來自於管理和投資抵押貸款資產組合，而非依賴於用戶數量或平台互動來增加價值。公司與客戶之間的關係是交易性的，而非基於網絡效應的增長。沒有證據表明 NLY 的服務會因為更多客戶的加入而變得更有價值，這意味著其業務難以形成自我強化的增長循環。","comment_en":"NLY's business model does not possess significant network effects. As a mortgage REIT, its value and revenue primarily derive from managing and investing in mortgage asset portfolios, rather than relying on user numbers or platform interactions to increase value. The relationship between the company and its clients is transactional, not based on network effect-driven growth. There is no evidence that NLY's services become more valuable as more customers join, meaning its business is unlikely to form a self-reinforcing growth cycle."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NLY 作為行業內的大型抵押貸款 REIT，在規模經濟方面具有一定的優勢。較大的資產規模使其能夠在融資、交易執行和管理費用上獲得一定的成本效益。大型機構通常能獲得更優惠的融資利率，並能分攤固定管理成本於更大的資產基礎上。然而，金融行業的規模優勢並非絕對，過度擴張也可能帶來風險。與其他金融機構相比，其成本結構的優勢相對有限，並非壓倒性的壁壘。","comment_en":"As a large mortgage REIT in the industry, NLY possesses certain advantages in economies of scale. A larger asset base allows for some cost efficiencies in financing, transaction execution, and management expenses. Large institutions typically secure more favorable financing rates and can spread fixed management costs over a larger asset base. However, the scale advantage in the financial industry is not absolute, and excessive expansion can also bring risks. Compared to other financial institutions, the advantage in its cost structure is relatively limited and not an overwhelming barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NLY 的業務性質使其難以建立獨特的地理資產壁壘。作為一家抵押貸款 REIT，其投資標的是全國範圍內的抵押貸款證券，而非特定地理位置的實體房地產。雖然其投資組合可能集中在某些地區，但這些資產本身並不具備獨特性或稀缺性，可以被其他市場參與者複製。公司無法依賴地理位置的優勢來獲取超額回報，其競爭優勢更多來自於金融操作和市場判斷，而非地理資產的獨特性。","comment_en":"NLY's business nature makes it difficult to establish unique geographical asset barriers. As a mortgage REIT, its investments are in mortgage-backed securities nationwide, rather than physical real estate in specific geographic locations. Although its portfolio may be concentrated in certain regions, these assets themselves do not possess uniqueness or scarcity and can be replicated by other market participants. The company cannot rely on geographical advantages to obtain excess returns; its competitive advantage stems more from financial operations and market judgment, rather than the uniqueness of geographical assets."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NLY 在運營效率方面表現穩健，這在其作為大型抵押貸款 REIT 的背景下尤為重要。公司需要精確管理其龐大的資產負債表，有效控制融資成本，並在複雜的金融市場中進行交易。其相對穩定的 ROE 和 ROA（儘管不高）顯示出一定的管理能力。然而，抵押貸款 REIT 的運營效率很大程度上受制於宏觀經濟和利率環境，其效率的提升空間可能受到行業結構性限制。與頂尖的金融機構相比，其效率優勢並非絕對領先。","comment_en":"NLY demonstrates solid operational efficiency, which is particularly important given its status as a large mortgage REIT. The company needs to precisely manage its substantial balance sheet, effectively control financing costs, and execute trades in complex financial markets. Its relatively stable ROE and ROA (though not high) indicate a degree of management capability. However, the operational efficiency of mortgage REITs is largely constrained by macroeconomic and interest rate environments, and the scope for efficiency improvement may be limited by structural industry constraints. Compared to top-tier financial institutions, its efficiency advantage is not an absolute lead."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NLY 的資本配置能力是其維持競爭力的關鍵。公司需要不斷地在不同類型的抵押貸款資產之間進行權衡，以尋求最佳的風險調整後回報。其過往的表現顯示出一定的資本配置能力，能夠在市場波動中尋找機會。然而，抵押貸款 REIT 的資本配置高度依賴於對利率走勢和信貸市場的預測，這本身就充滿不確定性。管理層能否持續做出優於市場平均水平的資本配置決策，是其護城河的關鍵所在，但這也面臨較大的外部挑戰。","comment_en":"NLY's capital allocation capability is crucial for maintaining its competitiveness. The company must constantly balance different types of mortgage assets to seek optimal risk-adjusted returns. Its past performance indicates a certain capital allocation ability, enabling it to find opportunities amidst market volatility. However, capital allocation for mortgage REITs heavily relies on forecasting interest rate trends and credit markets, which are inherently uncertain. Whether management can consistently make capital allocation decisions superior to the market average is key to its moat, but this also faces significant external challenges."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"NLY 的客戶留存率面臨挑戰，因為其客戶基礎主要是機構投資者，他們對回報率和風險的敏感度很高。這些投資者會持續比較不同 REIT 的表現和條款，一旦發現更有利的選擇，轉換的可能性較高。NLY 並未建立起強大的客戶忠誠度機制，其客戶關係更多是基於交易撮合和短期收益。要提高客戶留存，NLY 需要持續提供具有競爭力的回報和穩定的現金流，但這很大程度上取決於外部市場環境。","comment_en":"NLY faces challenges in customer retention as its client base primarily consists of institutional investors who are highly sensitive to returns and risks. These investors continuously compare the performance and terms of different REITs, and the likelihood of switching is relatively high if a more favorable option is found. NLY has not established strong customer loyalty mechanisms; its client relationships are more based on transaction matching and short-term gains. To improve customer retention, NLY needs to consistently provide competitive returns and stable cash flow, but this largely depends on the external market environment."},"m10_durability":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"NLY 的業務模式在抵押貸款 REIT 行業中具有一定的持久性，但其護城河的深度和廣度有限。該行業本身受到利率週期和宏觀經濟的顯著影響，這意味著其盈利能力存在波動性。NLY 的持久性更多體現在其作為行業參與者的經驗和規模，而非難以撼動的競爭壁壘。其商業模式類似於一個「收費橋」，在市場條件有利時能穩定產生費用，但在經濟下行或利率劇烈波動時，其收入和資產價值會受到嚴重威脅。其持久性依賴於對市場週期的有效管理。","comment_en":"NLY's business model has a certain durability within the mortgage REIT industry, but the depth and breadth of its moat are limited. The industry itself is significantly influenced by interest rate cycles and macroeconomic conditions, meaning its profitability is volatile. NLY's durability is more reflected in its experience and scale as an industry participant, rather than an unshakeable competitive barrier. Its business model is akin to a 'toll bridge,' generating stable fees when market conditions are favorable, but its revenue and asset values are severely threatened during economic downturns or sharp interest rate fluctuations. Its durability relies on effective management of market cycles."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"NLY 作為一家抵押貸款 REIT，其經濟護城河相對較弱，主要體現為一種「收費橋」模式，依賴於管理龐大的抵押貸款資產組合來獲取利差收入。其規模帶來了一定的成本優勢（M5），穩健的運營效率（M7）和資本配置能力（M8）也提供了一定的支撐。然而，NLY 缺乏品牌定價權（M1）、專利壁壘（M2）、網絡效應（M4）和獨特地理資產（M6）。客戶轉換成本低（M3）和客戶留存率不高（M9）進一步削弱了其競爭地位。其業務的持久性（M10）受制於利率週期和宏觀經濟波動，難以形成持續的超額回報。總體而言，NLY 的護城河不夠寬闊，其價值更多取決於對市場週期的精準把握和風險管理能力。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"As a mortgage REIT, NLY possesses a relatively weak economic moat, primarily functioning as a 'toll bridge' model that relies on managing a large portfolio of mortgage assets to generate net interest margin income. Its scale provides some cost advantages (M5), and its solid operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation capabilities (M8) offer some support. However, NLY lacks brand pricing power (M1), patent barriers (M2), network effects (M4), and unique geographical assets (M6). Low customer switching costs (M3) and retention rates (M9) further weaken its competitive position. The durability of its business (M10) is constrained by interest rate cycles and macroeconomic volatility, making sustained excess returns difficult. Overall, NLY's moat is not sufficiently wide, and its value depends more on precise market cycle navigation and risk management capabilities.","evidenceHash":"eed5d403b29e454450b42632b982774060025bbd975e7f2899f3354ec882a19a","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T00:03:43.369Z","evidenceHash":"7b038374c0bfdab41a8c3c21e139c28acc7f0958cc24996092901773209cf797"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-29T00:03:43.369Z","evidenceHash":"7b038374c0bfdab41a8c3c21e139c28acc7f0958cc24996092901773209cf797"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NLY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NLY.png","website":"https://www.annaly.com","ceo":"David L. Finkelstein","full_time_employees":"212","description":"Annaly Capital Management, Inc. (NLY) operates as a multifaceted financial firm, specializing in managing capital across various sectors. Its core business encompasses mortgage-related investments and lending to middle-market corporations. NLY strategically deploys capital across a diverse range of assets, including government-sponsored (Agency) and privately-issued (non-Agency) mortgage-backed securities, residential and commercial mortgage loans, mortgage servicing rights, credit risk transfer instruments, corporate debt, and other commercial real estate investments. Operating as a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), Annaly benefits from a particular tax structure. This designation exempts it from federal corporate income tax, provided it distributes the majority of its taxable earnings to its investors. Established in 1996, the firm's corporate headquarters are located in New York City.","description_en":"Annaly Capital Management, Inc. (NLY) operates as a multifaceted financial firm, specializing in managing capital across various sectors. Its core business encompasses mortgage-related investments and lending to middle-market corporations. NLY strategically deploys capital across a diverse range of assets, including government-sponsored (Agency) and privately-issued (non-Agency) mortgage-backed securities, residential and commercial mortgage loans, mortgage servicing rights, credit risk transfer instruments, corporate debt, and other commercial real estate investments. Operating as a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), Annaly benefits from a particular tax structure. This designation exempts it from federal corporate income tax, provided it distributes the majority of its taxable earnings to its investors. Established in 1996, the firm's corporate headquarters are located in New York City.","description_zh":"Annaly Capital Management, Inc.（美股代碼：NLY）為 Real Estate 領域之重要企業，專注於 REIT - Mortgage 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"1211 Avenue of the Americas","city":"New York City","state":"NY","zip":"10036","country":"US","phone":"212 696 0100","full_address":"1211 Avenue of the Americas, New York City, NY 10036, US","range_52w":"17.7-24.52","year_high":24.52,"year_low":17.7,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":17.7,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-04","name":"Finkelstein David L","title":"director, officer: CEO and  Co-CIO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":50000,"price":22.89,"total_val":1.14},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Hamilton Thomas Edward","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Hannan Kathy Hopinkah","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Laguerre Martin","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"VOTEK GLENN","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Laroche Manon","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Williams Vicki","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Wede Scott","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Reeves Eric A.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-18","name":"Reeves Eric A.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":7628,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[{"date":"2022-09-26","ratio":"1 : 4","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"}],"fmp_symbol":"NLY","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Annaly Capital Management, Inc.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-29T00:03:43.369Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"c